<title>CHINA: SHANGRI-LA ASIA INTERIM NET DOWN 6.3 PCT.</title>
<headline>SHANGRI-LA ASIA INTERIM NET DOWN 6.3 PCT.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-08-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months ended June 30</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   29.79 vs 34.07</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)     15.0 vs 15.0</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	    nil vs nil</p>
<p>    Net			   470.95 vs 502.48</p>
<p>    Turnover		  1,640.24 vs 1,404.41</p>
<p>    Company name		Shangri-la Asia Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  Sept 15-19</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   Oct 9</p>
<p>NOTE - Shangri-La Asia, the hotel arm of Malaysia's Kuok Group, has hotels and investment properties in China and Hong Kong.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong News Room (852) 2843 6368</p>
